# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Rise of the Silithid (4267).
# Left out: Lonebrow's Journal (1100). The Giant Guardian (2844) and Wandering Shay (2845) come on the later Feralas stop (50-60/04).
# Left out: Against Lord Shalzaru (2870, 2871; Shalzaru is 47, two over the 43-45 player here) and Zorbin's Zapped
# Giants and Fuel for the Zapping (7003, 7721; Sea Elementals and zapped giants 47-49, elite giants around them).
# The Gordunni ogres come after the grind to 45: their Shamans are 44-45 and the Mage-Lords 45-46.

# Mudsprocket: Drazzit Dripvalve's and Gizzix Grimegurgle's three Wyrmbog quests (98205, 98215, 98231, level 44,
# whelps and Firemane 41-44), on the ride west out of Dustwallow Marsh after Theramore. Shown only when you start the
# guide in Dustwallow Marsh (players coming from Shen'dralas skip it).

step Mudsprocket
  when zone "Dustwallow Marsh"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Before the ride west, take the road south-west out of Theramore to Mudsprocket, the goblin camp at the edge of the Wyrmbog. Drazzit and Gizzix stand together in the camp.
  accept 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  accept 98215
  accept 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

step The Wyrmbog
  when zone "Dustwallow Marsh"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The Wyrmtail grows in the bog east of the camp: gather it first. Then the Searing Hatchlings and Whelps (41-43) and the Firemane dragonkin nest in the bog north and west of Mudsprocket, on the way back; all of them drop the shed scales.
  tip Careful: the Firemane Scalebanes and Flamecallers are 43-44 and cast fire: pull them one at a time.
  collect 280092 quest 98231 @46.2,80.2 -- Wyrmtail
  kill 4323 quest 98205               -- Searing Hatchling
  kill 4324 quest 98205               -- Searing Whelp
  collect 279934 quest 98215          -- Shed Dark Dragonscale

step Mudsprocket
  when zone "Dustwallow Marsh"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  turnin 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  turnin 98215
  turnin 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

step Into The Barrens
  when !turnedin 93394
  zone The Barrens
  goto 49.5,78.4 "Into The Barrens"

step Thalanaar flight master
  when !turnedin 93394
  zone Feralas
  goto 89.5,45.9 "Thalanaar flight master"
  getfp "Thalanaar"

step Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold
  zone Feralas
  goto 43.3,42.7 "Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feathermoon

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Feathermoon Stronghold stands on Sardor Isle, off the Forgotten Coast: the boat from the coast's dock crosses to it. Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  getfp "Feathermoon" npc 8019        -- Fyldren Moonfeather
  accept 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  accept 2866                         -- Shandris Feathermoon, beside him
  sethome "Feathermoon Stronghold" npc 7736 -- Innkeeper Shyria
  accept 4124                         -- Latronicus Moonspear, at the top of the stronghold
  turnin 4124                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4125
  accept 2939                         -- Troyas Moonbreeze: his answer waits in Rut'theran Village, later
  accept 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze

