# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The eastern loop

step Grimtotem camp
  tip From Thalanaar ride west along the road to the Grimtotem camp north of it. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive.
  accept 2969                         -- Kindal Moonweaver
  complete 2969
  turnin 2969
  accept 2970                         -- Jer'kai Moonweaver

step Grimtotem tauren
  tip Careful: Namida Grimtotem, an elite of level 43, stands at the camp's north-east edge, around 67,39: pull the Naturalists, Raiders and Shamans away from her.
  kill 7726 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Naturalist
  kill 7725 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Raider
  kill 7727 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Shaman

step Jer'kai Moonweaver
  turnin 2970
  accept 2972                         -- for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47

step The Writhing Deep
  tip Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out.
  turnin 4131                         -- Large Leather Backpacks
  accept 4135
  collect 11463                       -- Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks
  accept 4281
  turnin 4135                         -- Zukk'ash Pod, inside
  accept 4265
  complete 4265

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 45 in Feral Scar Vale

step Grind to 45
  zone Feralas
  tip Ride west into Feral Scar Vale: grind its Feral Scar Yetis (43-44) to 45, and take Pratt's thick hides from them as you go; the Groddoc Apes (42-43) on the slopes to the south drop Rhapsody's livers. Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle and the Hulking Feral Scars (45-46) the north end. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.
  collect 8973 quest 2821             -- Thick Yeti Hide
  collect 6259 quest 1452.3 @57.5,56.5 map 1444 -- Groddoc Liver
  level 45 grind 5292 -- grind on Feral Scar Yeti at Feral Scar Vale, Feralas

step Gordunni ogres
  when level>=45
  tip Ride south-east to the Gordunni camp in the hills beside the yeti valley: Warlocks and Shaman hold the camp, Brutes wander the slopes around it and further north.
  tip Careful: the Gordunni Mage-Lords (45-46) cast from range among the Shaman: pull one at a time from the camp's edge.
  kill 5236 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Shaman
  kill 5232 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Brute
  kill 5240 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Warlock

step Ironfur bears
  zone Feralas
  when level>=45
  tip Ride north out of the Gordunni hills: the Ironfur Bears (41-42) at the foot of the High Wilderness drop Rhapsody's last liver.
  tip Careful: Ironfur Patriarchs (48-49) and the Rage Scar yetis (46-49) roam the hills further north: stay at their edge.
  collect 6258 quest 1452.2 @53.2,47.3 map 1444

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Angelas Moonbreeze stands beside Ginro's building; Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in it: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze
  turnin 4265                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4266
  turnin 4266                         -- Shandris Feathermoon
  accept 4267

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  note Shandris then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead.
  turnin 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben, by the flight master
  note Pratt's next order, Improved Quality, wants Rage Scar hides from yetis of 46-49: skip it.

